552 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 368 0 R
/E ( The macrophage theory offers hope for treatment-resistant patients and connects mental health to physical health, which feels intuitive to younger generations. But it is still emerging, and the evidence is correlational. It risks repeating the same pattern of reducing depression to one biological cause and selling a new drug to fix it.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
>>
