/Title (ur world is littered with duplicates. Lots of what we consume on a daily basis is in fact a replica of something more simple, perhaps with added bells and whistles. For example, the pride of our generation, an iced shaken caramel latte frappe \(the list of adjectives goes on\) is just coffee and syrups for the most part. In physics and mathematics, many equations we thought to be singular are in fact a part of a family of equations that really mean the same thing, but can still be useful in their own right in different situations.)
